    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450820/extras/9fde6b30b392ec0ce73925ad5c37f24f.poster.avif?t=1749462005\" width=626 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450820/extras/9fde6b30b392ec0ce73925ad5c37f24f.webm?t=1749462005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> AN INTRICATE MYSTERY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Worn Out</i> is a choice-driven psychological horror visual novel that follows a man moving into a new home\u2014only to discover that things are not what they seem. Every decision you make shapes the story and leads you to discover more about your past, your present, and what\u2019s lurking in the shadows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE OR FACE YOUR FATE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices determine your fate. What you decide matters. Some paths can\u2019t be undone, and each choice brings you closer to the truth\u2014or to something far worse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PIECE IT TOGETHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the pieces of your past, the mysteries surrounding your new life, and the secrets you\u2019ve buried. Each decision leads you closer to understanding\u2014or further into the unknown.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BE TRUTHFUL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world full of questions, your answers matter. Be honest with yourself, or risk losing everything. Can you handle the truth? Or will you let the lies control your fate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450820/extras/b2e19956c2a2738baba3a97862f7fd31.poster.avif?t=1749462005\" width=626 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450820/extras/b2e19956c2a2738baba3a97862f7fd31.webm?t=1749462005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Completely hand-drawn pixel art</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative that changes with your choices</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings based on the path you take</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plenty of decisions that affect your journey\u2014replay to uncover different clues and storylines</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An unsettling presence who seems... a little too interested in your past</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450820/extras/9fde6b30b392ec0ce73925ad5c37f24f.poster.avif?t=1749462005\" width=626 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450820/extras/9fde6b30b392ec0ce73925ad5c37f24f.webm?t=1749462005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> AN INTRICATE MYSTERY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Worn Out</i> is a choice-driven psychological horror visual novel that follows a man moving into a new home\u2014only to discover that things are not what they seem. Every decision you make shapes the story and leads you to discover more about your past, your present, and what\u2019s lurking in the shadows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE OR FACE YOUR FATE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices determine your fate. What you decide matters. Some paths can\u2019t be undone, and each choice brings you closer to the truth\u2014or to something far worse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PIECE IT TOGETHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the pieces of your past, the mysteries surrounding your new life, and the secrets you\u2019ve buried. Each decision leads you closer to understanding\u2014or further into the unknown.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BE TRUTHFUL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world full of questions, your answers matter. Be honest with yourself, or risk losing everything. Can you handle the truth? Or will you let the lies control your fate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450820/extras/b2e19956c2a2738baba3a97862f7fd31.poster.avif?t=1749462005\" width=626 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450820/extras/b2e19956c2a2738baba3a97862f7fd31.webm?t=1749462005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Completely hand-drawn pixel art</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative that changes with your choices</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings based on the path you take</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plenty of decisions that affect your journey\u2014replay to uncover different clues and storylines</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An unsettling presence who seems... a little too interested in your past</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A presence lingers in the dark, waiting. It asks. It doubts. It knows. What happened? Why are you here? Do you deserve this? The answers are yours to decide. What you choose matters. Every path leads somewhere. But will you like where it takes you?",
